      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792703568523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "connection 1: browser -> ALB      (HTTPS)\nconnection 2: ALB -> ingress EC2   (new TCP)\n\nThe ALB picks a healthy instance and\nFORWARDS the request. It is not a redirect:\nthe browser never sees the ingress.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "connection 1: browser -> ALB      (HTTPS)\nconnection 2: ALB -> ingress EC2   (new TCP)\n\nThe ALB picks a healthy instance and\nFORWARDS the request. It is not a redirect:\nthe browser never sees the ingress.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
